cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the article (preferred citation) and this repository."
title: "Persistent departures from pre-COVID HIV diagnosis trends in the EU/EEA, 2022–2024: code and data"
abstract: >-
  R code, extracted public data (ECDC/WHO HIV/AIDS surveillance reports for data years 2015-2024; Eurostat
  migr_asytpspop), result tables and figure code for an ecological analysis of HIV diagnoses in 30 EU/EEA
  countries by transmission category, sex and country.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
